            "review_title": "Review at Mangetsu Shochu Bar",
            "review_text": "Regine C\nSeoul, South Korea1 contribution\n0\nTerrible Service\nOct 2025 • Friends\nGoodbye After 10 Years – Terrible Service!\nAfter 10 years of loyalty, I’m done. Rude manager and front door staff in Le Thanh Ton outlet . \n\nCalled at 7:30 PM for a table at 8:20 PM and was told fully booked until 11 PM — yet walk-ins were still accepted.\n\nAt around 8:20 PM, three Western guests arrived without a reservation and were told a table would be ready in 15 minutes. I was told to wait until 10 PM, and I agreed. Later, two ladies came and were told to wait only until 9 PM — how does that make sense?\n\nWhen I questioned this, the manager said, “Sorry our policy disappointed you, but we’re full now. We told them 9 PM because a table for two is easier to arrange.”\n\nWhat kind of answer is that? What’s the point of having a reservation or walk-in policy if it’s applied so unfairly?\n\nAfter I complained and they had no proper response, they offered me a glass of beer while I waited for my friend, then told me to go to their Thai Van Lung outlet instead. I rejected with such discrimination and disrespectful service and treatment — absolutely unacceptable. \n\nNever coming back .\nRead more\nWritten October 20, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
